WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.938
Learn how sponsored Brands store spotlight format can help you showcase the variety of products

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:09.877
or categories you sell by featuring multiple pages from your brand store within the ad.

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:15.474
This format displays three pages of your store as a visual menu, allowing shoppers to explore what

00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:18.108
interests them most while discovering your product range.

00:00:18.108 --> 00:00:23.705
Let's explore how to create a store spotlight campaign that features three key areas of your store.

00:00:23.705 --> 00:00:24.363
Step 1.

00:00:24.363 --> 00:00:27.326
Select sponsored brands and choose the store spotlight format.

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.960
Then pick three sub-pages that represent different

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.498
product lines or use cases, like new arrivals, bestsellers, or recipes.

00:00:34.498 --> 00:00:36.560
For each sub-page, choose

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.451
a representative product.

00:00:37.451 --> 00:00:40.720
Keeping in mind, images will be pulled from your detail pages

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.520
and select a representative label.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.240
Step 2.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.760
Write a unified headline that connects your

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:46.622
featured categories.

00:00:46.622 --> 00:00:49.206
For example, essentials for every chef.

00:00:49.206 --> 00:00:51.360
Keep it short, clear, and

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.437
reflective of your brand's voice.

00:00:53.437 --> 00:00:54.268
Step 3.

00:00:54.268 --> 00:00:56.760
Use broad keyword themes that capture

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:59.409
diverse shopping interests across your featured pages.

00:00:59.409 --> 00:01:01.680
Plus product specific terms tied to

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:03.231
your featured sub-pages.

00:01:03.231 --> 00:01:06.720
For product targeting, implement wider category themes to match

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:11.920
the variety of products showcased in your sub-pages, always refining to match your offerings.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:16.260
Choose from two keyword themes and learn from your search term report to refine your keyword

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:16.745
selection.

00:01:16.745 --> 00:01:17.714
Step 4.

00:01:17.714 --> 00:01:21.106
Design each featured sub-page for conversion.

00:01:21.106 --> 00:01:22.560
Position advertised products

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:27.300
at the top and utilize widgets such as product collections and shoppable images to showcase

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:28.671
your products in action.

00:01:28.671 --> 00:01:32.100
Keep branding consistent across the journey to keep shoppers engaged

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.021
wherever they click.

00:01:33.021 --> 00:01:36.400
This strategy helps to encourage shoppers to discover more of your

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:36.731
store.

00:01:36.731 --> 00:01:41.040
Each page preview helps shoppers explore different product lines and find what matches

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:42.006
their needs.

00:01:42.006 --> 00:01:47.320
Make informed decisions using your brand store insights to identify opportunities.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:52.280
Click the Pages tab looking at traffic and conversion rates to help increase traffic on

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.394
low-visited pages and capitalize on your top converting pages.

00:01:56.394 --> 00:01:58.040
Put learning into practice.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:02.960
Build a Sponsored Brands Store Spotlight campaign and feature three sections of your brand store.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:06.880
Watch our other two videos in this series to learn more ways to connect sponsored brands

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:07.840
to your brand store.
